        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Battle of Saint-Dizier, War of the Sixth Coalition, Hundred Days\n- People: Napoleon I\n- Roles: Emperor of the French\n\nFacts:\n- Napoleon I was Emperor of the French from 1804 until 1814.\n- The Battle of Saint-Dizier was fought on 26 March 1814 during the War of the Sixth Coalition.\n- The Battle of Saint-Dizier is notable as Napoleon I's last victory before he abdicated.\n- Napoleon I briefly ruled again as Emperor of the French in 1815 during the Hundred Days.",
